{"name": "read_mail", "args": {"message_id": "304ab3cc9cad43d2146b4561eae191d9884e8595bbe865c5d413a938a77a7d8c", "offset": 0, "limit": 10000}, "result": {"text": "林然，\r\n\r\n林禾刚把这周三个培训场次的报名表导出来了，CSV 和简短说明都放在附件里。你帮我整理成一页简报吧，主要让我看清各场还有多少名额，不需要长篇分析。\r\n\r\n给我一个 Word 方便改字，再附相同内容的 PDF。你先做好放回信里，我看过后再决定转发给谁。今天下班前准备好即可，不急着发出去。\r\n\r\n谢谢！\r\n顾遥\r\n青岚博物馆 · 教育活动组\r\n", "offset": 0, "endOffset": 177, "totalCharacters": 177, "nextOffset": null, "complete": true, "fromAddress": "guyao@museum.example.invalid", "fromName": "顾遥", "replyToAddresses": [], "toAddresses": ["linran@practice.invalid"], "ccAddresses": [], "messageId": "<training-brief-1122@museum.example.invalid>", "inReplyTo": "", "references": [], "identityWarnings": [], "identitySource": "rfc-headers", "bindingId": "1d798150-12ea-4bdb-bb22-35046bea59d9", "accountEmail": "linran@practice.invalid", "mailboxIdentity": "imap:9ca7055fe2b181e48d2e06cbc311308456ba16081aa79fd9db0b7f3260283c9d", "id": "304ab3cc9cad43d2146b4561eae191d9884e8595bbe865c5d413a938a77a7d8c", "subject": "帮忙整理教育志愿者培训的报名简报", "sender": "顾遥 <guyao@museum.example.invalid>", "receivedAt": "2026-11-22T01:05:00.000Z", "bodyStatus": "complete", "attachments": [{"index": 0, "name": "报名统计.csv", "type": "text/csv", "size": 136, "inline": false}, {"index": 1, "name": "简报说明.md", "type": "text/markdown", "size": 736, "inline": false}], "evidenceComplete": true}, "executionId": "12d09b80-6546-444d-a0b8-b03cf47d0b36", "thread": "agent-secretary"}
{"name": "read_mail", "args": {"message_id": "7ff3c1feb993bb92eb14439961a9a336d90c8dc5b7d4f5d3066749f0e7a0f764", "offset": 0, "limit": 10000}, "result": {"text": "同学们好，\r\n\r\n这次小组项目请在 11 月 30 日晚上 23:59（香港时间）前上传到课程平台。每组交一份 PDF 报告和可运行的代码压缩包，报告正文最多 6 页，参考文献不计入。\r\n\r\n12 月 2 日上课时展示，每组讲 5 分钟，再留 2 分钟问答。报告和展示是两件事，不要把上传时间记成展示当天。\r\n\r\n有问题可以回复这封邮件。\r\n陈知远\r\n", "offset": 0, "endOffset": 176, "totalCharacters": 176, "nextOffset": null, "complete": true, "fromAddress": "chen@course.example.invalid", "fromName": "陈知远", "replyToAddresses": [], "toAddresses": ["linran@practice.invalid"], "ccAddresses": [], "messageId": "<comp6280-project-1122@course.example.invalid>", "inReplyTo": "", "references": [], "identityWarnings": [], "identitySource": "rfc-headers", "bindingId": "1d798150-12ea-4bdb-bb22-35046bea59d9", "accountEmail": "linran@practice.invalid", "mailboxIdentity": "imap:9ca7055fe2b181e48d2e06cbc311308456ba16081aa79fd9db0b7f3260283c9d", "id": "7ff3c1feb993bb92eb14439961a9a336d90c8dc5b7d4f5d3066749f0e7a0f764", "subject": "COMP6280 小组项目提交安排", "sender": "陈知远 <chen@course.example.invalid>", "receivedAt": "2026-11-22T00:10:00.000Z", "bodyStatus": "complete", "attachments": [], "evidenceComplete": true}, "executionId": "12d09b80-6546-444d-a0b8-b03cf47d0b36", "thread": "agent-secretary"}
